# Pipelined core (design/pipe/core_pipe.sv) file list, in required
# compile order. One path per line, relative to the repo root. Blank lines
# and #-comments ignored.
#
# design_files.list with design/core.sv swapped for design/pipe/: the
# pipe reuses the FSM's own leaf modules (decoder/alu/c_expand/csr_file/
# register_file) unmodified, and -DQV_PIPE_AS_CORE (passed by
# run_regress.sh/lint.sh's --core pipe) names core_pipe `core`, so
# soc.sv and every harness need no pipe-specific variant. decoder.sv
# comes first: it defines INSTR_CODE, which qv_decode.sv uses.
design/decoder.sv
design/alu.sv
design/c_expand.sv
design/cache_complex.sv
design/clint.sv
design/pipe/qv_pkg.sv
design/pipe/qv_fetch.sv
design/pipe/qv_align.sv
design/pipe/qv_fifo.sv
design/pipe/qv_decode.sv
design/pipe/qv_issue.sv
design/pipe/qv_rob.sv
design/pipe/qv_exu_alu.sv
design/pipe/qv_exu_bru.sv
design/pipe/qv_commit.sv
design/pipe/core_pipe.sv
design/csr_file.sv
design/dcache.sv
design/divider.sv
design/dm.sv
design/dm_dmi.sv
design/icache.sv
design/jtag_tap.sv
design/plic.sv
design/register_file.sv
design/soc.sv
design/uart16550.sv
design/wb4_sram.sv
design/wb_addr_decoder.sv
design/wb_arbiter2.sv
